#NEXUS

[ d'emic2012b_fig3: Salgado et al. (1997) as parsed by D'Emic: a slanted (diagonal) pectinate tree, fully resolved. The other five small trees and the two consensus trees are excluded by the region. 7 tips, fully resolved. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=7;
    TAXLABELS
        Diplodocidae
        Camarasauridae
        Brachiosaurus
        Chubutisaurus
        Andesaurus
        Malawisaurus
        mdt
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE 'd''emic2012b_fig3' = [&R] (Diplodocidae,(Camarasauridae,(Brachiosaurus,(Chubutisaurus,(Andesaurus,(Malawisaurus,mdt))))));
END;
